## API image — same acceptance policy. Everything fixable in range was
## upgraded (multer 2.4.0, qs 6.16.1, body-parser 1.20.8, js-yaml 4.3.2,
## lodash 4.18.1). The batch below is gated on the Nest single-number
## upgrade (10 -> 12), which also lands body-parser 2.x / file-type 21 /
## uuid 14 / js-yaml 5 natively; do not patch these piecemeal.

## @nestjs/core — fixed in 11.1.18; running 10.4.22. Clears with the
## Nest 12 upgrade.
CVE-2026-35515

## js-yaml !!omap resolver — fixed only in the 5.x line (5.2.1); the 4.x
## line never got the backport (verified by the advisory's own matrix).
GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj

## file-type — fixed in 21.3.1 / 21.3.2; 20.4.1 hoisted by
## @nestjs/common@10. file-type 21 is a breaking consumer-facing major.
CVE-2026-31808
CVE-2026-32630

